{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14038","headline":"奉送蒋尚书兼御史大夫东都留守 · 耿湋","name":"奉送蒋尚书兼御史大夫东都留守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"副相威名重，春卿礼乐崇。\n锡珪仍拜下，分命遂居东。\n高斾翻秋日，清铙引细风。\n蝉稀金谷树，草徧德阳宫。\n敎用儒门俭，兵依武库雄。\n谁云千载後，周召独爲公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}